OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FLinton Stephens introduces
OL,7,     Fhighlights from the BBC Proms,
OL,8,     Fincluding Strauss' Death and
OL,9,     FTransfiguration; plus song from
OL,10,     FNicky Spence and Julius Drake at
OL,11,     Fthe Aldeburgh Festival.
OL,12,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,13,     FLive from Gloucester Cathedral
OL,14,     Fduring the Three Choirs Festival,
OL,15,     Fwith music by Hurd, Gavin Higgins,
OL,16,     FWesley and Bliss.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Alice Smith
OL,18,     F3/5. Donald Macleod surveys some
OL,19,     Fof Alice Mary Smith's
OL,20,     Fcompositional collaborations,
OL,21,     Fincluding with the famed
OL,22,     Fclarinettist Henry Lazarus.
